{"fps": 30, "frames": 1641, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 188, "text": "In eighteen forty-six, Charlotte Bront\u00eb begged her sisters to sell a very good railway.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "eighteen", "f": 7, "e": 18}, {"w": "forty-six,", "f": 21, "e": 50}, {"w": "Charlotte", "f": 53, "e": 62}, {"w": "Bront\u00eb", "f": 64, "e": 78}, {"w": "begged", "f": 82, "e": 89}, {"w": "her", "f": 91, "e": 96}, {"w": "sisters", "f": 97, "e": 107}, {"w": "to", "f": 110, "e": 114}, {"w": "sell", "f": 118, "e": 121}, {"w": "a", "f": 123, "e": 130}, {"w": "very", "f": 135, "e": 139}, {"w": "good", "f": 142, "e": 146}, {"w": "railway.", "f": 149, "e": 176}]}, {"a": 188, "b": 300, "text": "Imagine you're Charlotte, in a windy Yorkshire parsonage.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 190, "e": 201}, {"w": "you're", "f": 202, "e": 208}, {"w": "Charlotte,", "f": 215, "e": 229}, {"w": "in", "f": 230, "e": 231}, {"w": "a", "f": 233, "e": 238}, {"w": "windy", "f": 241, "e": 249}, {"w": "Yorkshire", "f": 254, "e": 263}, {"w": "parsonage.", "f": 266, "e": 291}]}, {"a": 300, "b": 430, "text": "Quiet Emily put your aunt's money into the York and North Midland Railway.", "words": [{"w": "Quiet", "f": 302, "e": 311}, {"w": "Emily", "f": 313, "e": 327}, {"w": "put", "f": 329, "e": 331}, {"w": "your", "f": 334, "e": 338}, {"w": "aunt's", "f": 339, "e": 347}, {"w": "money", "f": 350, "e": 357}, {"w": "into", "f": 360, "e": 363}, {"w": "the", "f": 366, "e": 368}, {"w": "York", "f": 373, "e": 377}, {"w": "and", "f": 379, "e": 382}, {"w": "North", "f": 385, "e": 389}, {"w": "Midland", "f": 391, "e": 400}, {"w": "Railway.", "f": 402, "e": 430}]}, {"a": 430, "b": 608, "text": "Now Britain has railway fever. The vicar buys shares. His horse looks worried.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "f": 432, "e": 441}, {"w": "Britain", "f": 446, "e": 455}, {"w": "has", "f": 457, "e": 462}, {"w": "railway", "f": 466, "e": 478}, {"w": "fever.", "f": 482, "e": 510}, {"w": "The", "f": 511, "e": 512}, {"w": "vicar", "f": 514, "e": 523}, {"w": "buys", "f": 526, "e": 533}, {"w": "shares.", "f": 539, "e": 558}, {"w": "His", "f": 561, "e": 565}, {"w": "horse", "f": 569, "e": 574}, {"w": "looks", "f": 576, "e": 583}, {"w": "worried.", "f": 585, "e": 608}]}, {"a": 608, "b": 711, "text": "A very good line, you write, but not at these premiums.", "words": [{"w": "A", "f": 610, "e": 613}, {"w": "very", "f": 615, "e": 622}, {"w": "good", "f": 624, "e": 626}, {"w": "line,", "f": 629, "e": 639}, {"w": "you", "f": 641, "e": 642}, {"w": "write,", "f": 646, "e": 658}, {"w": "but", "f": 661, "e": 663}, {"w": "not", "f": 665, "e": 667}, {"w": "at", "f": 670, "e": 672}, {"w": "these", "f": 675, "e": 679}, {"w": "premiums.", "f": 681, "e": 711}]}, {"a": 711, "b": 782, "text": "So why sell a great railway?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 713, "e": 718}, {"w": "why", "f": 720, "e": 727}, {"w": "sell", "f": 731, "e": 738}, {"w": "a", "f": 739, "e": 741}, {"w": "great", "f": 743, "e": 750}, {"w": "railway?", "f": 752, "e": 782}]}, {"a": 782, "b": 869, "text": "You see, picture the finest house on your street.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 784, "e": 786}, {"w": "see,", "f": 789, "e": 800}, {"w": "picture", "f": 802, "e": 809}, {"w": "the", "f": 811, "e": 816}, {"w": "finest", "f": 818, "e": 830}, {"w": "house", "f": 833, "e": 837}, {"w": "on", "f": 839, "e": 841}, {"w": "your", "f": 843, "e": 848}, {"w": "street.", "f": 853, "e": 869}]}, {"a": 869, "b": 997, "text": "Lovely house. At triple the price, a terrible buy.", "words": [{"w": "Lovely", "f": 871, "e": 880}, {"w": "house.", "f": 882, "e": 905}, {"w": "At", "f": 907, "e": 910}, {"w": "triple", "f": 912, "e": 921}, {"w": "the", "f": 923, "e": 926}, {"w": "price,", "f": 933, "e": 946}, {"w": "a", "f": 950, "e": 953}, {"w": "terrible", "f": 957, "e": 969}, {"w": "buy.", "f": 975, "e": 997}]}, {"a": 997, "b": 1079, "text": "Emily won't sell, so you give in.", "words": [{"w": "Emily", "f": 999, "e": 1008}, {"w": "won't", "f": 1010, "e": 1017}, {"w": "sell,", "f": 1022, "e": 1035}, {"w": "so", "f": 1038, "e": 1042}, {"w": "you", "f": 1045, "e": 1049}, {"w": "give", "f": 1051, "e": 1054}, {"w": "in.", "f": 1056, "e": 1077}]}, {"a": 1079, "b": 1224, "text": "Then the fever breaks, and the Railway King, George Hudson, falls.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 1081, "e": 1086}, {"w": "the", "f": 1088, "e": 1093}, {"w": "fever", "f": 1095, "e": 1102}, {"w": "breaks,", "f": 1104, "e": 1123}, {"w": "and", "f": 1124, "e": 1125}, {"w": "the", "f": 1127, "e": 1129}, {"w": "Railway", "f": 1134, "e": 1141}, {"w": "King,", "f": 1145, "e": 1157}, {"w": "George", "f": 1159, "e": 1166}, {"w": "Hudson,", "f": 1168, "e": 1186}, {"w": "falls.", "f": 1193, "e": 1223}]}, {"a": 1224, "b": 1408, "text": "Eighteen forty-nine. Your shares, issued at fifty pounds, once hit one hundred and twenty.", "words": [{"w": "Eighteen", "f": 1226, "e": 1234}, {"w": "forty-nine.", "f": 1237, "e": 1271}, {"w": "Your", "f": 1273, "e": 1278}, {"w": "shares,", "f": 1280, "e": 1298}, {"w": "issued", "f": 1303, "e": 1307}, {"w": "at", "f": 1310, "e": 1312}, {"w": "fifty", "f": 1314, "e": 1321}, {"w": "pounds,", "f": 1323, "e": 1344}, {"w": "once", "f": 1347, "e": 1351}, {"w": "hit", "f": 1353, "e": 1360}, {"w": "one", "f": 1362, "e": 1365}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 1367, "e": 1376}, {"w": "and", "f": 1378, "e": 1381}, {"w": "twenty.", "f": 1387, "e": 1408}]}, {"a": 1408, "b": 1465, "text": "Now they're down at twenty.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "f": 1410, "e": 1417}, {"w": "they're", "f": 1419, "e": 1424}, {"w": "down", "f": 1427, "e": 1431}, {"w": "at", "f": 1433, "e": 1435}, {"w": "twenty.", "f": 1438, "e": 1465}]}, {"a": 1465, "b": 1641, "text": "Same tracks. Same trains. A very good line, at a very bad price.", "words": [{"w": "Same", "f": 1467, "e": 1474}, {"w": "tracks.", "f": 1481, "e": 1495}, {"w": "Same", "f": 1498, "e": 1502}, {"w": "trains.", "f": 1504, "e": 1529}, {"w": "A", "f": 1533, "e": 1536}, {"w": "very", "f": 1541, "e": 1545}, {"w": "good", "f": 1547, "e": 1550}, {"w": "line,", "f": 1552, "e": 1570}, {"w": "at", "f": 1571, "e": 1573}, {"w": "a", "f": 1575, "e": 1579}, {"w": "very", "f": 1582, "e": 1591}, {"w": "bad", "f": 1595, "e": 1600}, {"w": "price.", "f": 1607, "e": 1623}]}]}